function hero(){return `<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT LITTLE WIN</div><h1>好优惠，<br>也有<em>好回报。</em></h1><p>从心动好物到下一次出发，发现值得的优惠。<br>探索品牌、完成任务，让每一份积分都有新去处。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#offers" data-action="scroll-offers">发现今日优惠 <span>↗</span></a><a class="button light" href="#earn">探索奖励 <span>✦</span></a></div><div class="hero-trust"><span><i>✓</i> 免费发现优惠</span><span><i>✓</i> 自主选择任务</span><span><i>◇</i> Monad 驱动</span></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="精选优惠券和积分奖励插画"><div class="hero-orbit"></div><span class="hero-asterisk">✳</span><div class="ticket"><div class="ticket-header"><span class="mini-logo">✓</span> YOUR NEXT FIND</div><strong>30% OFF</strong><p>发现值得心动的小美好</p><div class="ticket-separator"></div><div class="ticket-bottom"><span>COUPON UNLOCKED</span><span>示例优惠券</span></div></div><div class="floating-star">✦</div><div class="reward-ticket"><div class="reward-label"><span>A LITTLE EXTRA</span><span>✦</span></div><strong>+120 <small style="font-size:14px">积分</small></strong><p>探索一下，奖励多一点。</p><div class="reward-footer"><span>DEMO REWARD</span><span>↗</span></div></div><div class="monad-tag"><span class="monad-mark"></span> LITTLE PERKS. ON MONAD.</div></div></div><div class="brand-strip"><span>发现你喜欢的品牌<br><small>示例品牌展示</small></span><span class="brand-word nike">NIKE ✓</span><span class="brand-word amazon">amazon</span><span class="brand-word iherb">iHerb</span><span class="brand-word trip">Trip.com</span><span class="brand-word notion">Notion</span><span class="brand-word">adidas</span></div></section>`}
function howBlock(){return `<section class="how-section"><div class="container how-layout"><div class="how-intro"><p class="section-kicker">SMALL STEPS, MORE PERKS</p><h2>省一点，赚一点。<br>简单，就很好。</h2><p>把日常的小发现，变成下一份奖励。</p></div><div class="how-step"><div class="step-number">01</div><h3>发现你喜欢的优惠</h3><p>搜品牌、选分类、收藏好物。<br>优惠条款，一眼看清。</p></div><div class="how-step"><div class="step-number">02</div><h3>自由参与品牌任务</h3><p>了解活动后，自主选择参与。<br>确认符合条件后，积分到账。</p></div><div class="how-step"><div class="step-number">03</div><h3>兑换你的下一份奖励</h3><p>积累可兑换积分，连接钱包。<br>在 Monad 上体验奖励领取。</p></div></div></section>`}
